<section class="bhd-page__feature"><div><p class="bhd-page__kicker">Partnership philosophy</p><h2>Put the athlete and the relationship before the endorsement</h2><p>Useful athlete and team partnerships start with fit. Hydration should already matter to the person, program or event. From there, expectations can be defined clearly: what product support is involved, what content or appearances are expected, what permissions apply, and which claims are appropriate.</p><p>Best Hydrate aims to build relationships that can stand on their own without exaggerating either the athlete's experience or the product's role in performance.</p></div></section>

<section class="bhd-page__cards-section"><p class="bhd-page__kicker">Explore</p><h2>Athletes, ambassadors and team opportunities</h2><div class="bhd-page__cards bhd-page__cards--3">
